// The engine's JSON shapes: named records in place of anonymous types, so the JSON metadata is source-generated
// (EngineJsonContext) and the engine trims and compiles ahead of time. Property names, order and types are those
// of the anonymous objects they replace, so every serialized document is unchanged. Named after the member that
// first builds them.
#pragma warning disable IDE1006 // JSON member names (ok, error, @event...), as the documents spell them

